A quote's first-block plus takes a list that carries its quote prefixes at its marker column

```
> - > q
>   > > +
>   > - s
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <blockquote>
        <p>q</p>
        <blockquote>
          <ul>
            <li>s</li>
          </ul>
        </blockquote>
      </blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
> - > +
- s
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <blockquote><p>+
- s</p></blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
- > > +
  - s
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <blockquote><p>+
- s</p></blockquote>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```
